                <b style="font-size: 22px">Subj:</b>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-11 mt-2 ms-2">
            <span style="
    margin-left: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: bold;">
                Intimation Letter – <span class="pcategory"></span> <span class="ptype"></span> - Svc Benefit - N-Stack
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 mt-2 mb-5" style="text-align:justify;">
           <ol style="padding-left:7px;">

    <!-- 1 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            The Management of N-Stack is pleased to inform that you have been allotted a
                        <b><span class="ptype"></span></b> measuring <b>
                            <span class="pcategory"></span> 
                            (<span class="psqryard"></span> Square Yards)</b> in N-Stack vide
                            GHQ AG’s Branch (W&R Dte) ltr No. <span class="pletterNo"></span>.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 2 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            The plot is liable to be cancelled on account of belated observations by PS, CORO and W&R Dtes. 
            Transfer of Plot shall be permitted only after clearance of all outstanding dues at time of transfer. 
            The allotted plot cannot be sold without NOC from GHQ AG’s Branch (W&R Dte).
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 3 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            Plot No Letter and Schedule of Development Charges will be shared in later time frame after approval of W&R Dte.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 4 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            <u><b>Dues/ Payment Schedule.</b></u> You are requested to pay Rs. 
            <b><span class="ppaymentStatment"></span></b> as Membership fee within a month. 
            Membership form is also attached for fill up and return to this office as per instruction. 
            Payment to N-Stack will be made through a Bank Draft/ Pay Order in favour of N-Stack 
            alongwith covering letter containing particulars i.e PA No, Rank, Name and Reference Number.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 5 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            N-Stack reserves the right to make adjustment and relocate the plot, if need arises due to site constraints 
            or change in town planning. In view of escalation and other essential reasons, additional development 
            charges may be imposed, if necessary.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 6 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            <u><b>Security Charges.</b></u> Security charges as prescribed by N-Stack will be levied after the possession is opened 
            till the commencement of construction.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 7 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            <u><b>Non Utilization Fee.</b></u> After the possession is opened, the owner is required to construct the building 
            (Residential/Commercial), within three years. In case of failure to construct the building, non construction 
            penalty will be levied as per N-Stack bylaws/ policy till the commencement of construction.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 8 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            <u><b>Allotment.</b></u> Formal allotment letter will be issued after clearance of all dues.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 9 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            <u><b>Surcharge.</b></u> All registered members are required to make payments as per the attached schedule. 
            A surcharge @@<span class="pSurcharge"></span>% per annum for delay of each day shall be levied on 
            the defaulted amount as per N-Stack bylaws.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 10 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            <u><b>Excess Area Charges.</b></u> Excess area upto 5 Marlas will be given to the member at N-Stack prescribed rates. 
            Excess area over and above 5 Marlas will be given, subject to approval of the Executive Board and excess 
            area charges will be determined by the N-Stack Management.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 11 -->
    <li>
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            We assure you of our best cooperation at all the times.
        </p>
    </li>

</ol>

